{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#1073","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#1073","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#1073\",\"parent_revision\":\"34ee7863a9588fdd19917de3d40af7058e246842d2868a1581cb7f96d4d166b5\",\"root_revision\":\"34ee7863a9588fdd19917de3d40af7058e246842d2868a1581cb7f96d4d166b5\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: \\ntype: Feature\\nstatus: closed\\nadded: \\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nThe backlog_list search parameter does basic case-insensitive substring matching across title, section, topic, and type fields. This fails to find items when the search term is a synonym or partial match of the actual content. Example: searching \\\"pluggable backend\\\" failed to find \\\"Abstract GitHub Issues layer from backlog MCP server into pluggable backend\\\" (#389) and \\\"Backend-first artifact storage providers\\\" (#984) \u2014 required multiple manual attempts with different terms before \\\"backend\\\" alone matched.\\n\\nCurrent search lacks: OR queries (backend OR provider), AND queries (backend AND protocol), regex patterns, full-text search with stemming/tokenization, and field-specific search (title:backend, description:protocol).\\n\\nImpact: orchestrators waste tool calls and context window space iterating on search terms. During the 2026-03-25 grooming session for #912, 8 separate backlog_list calls were needed to find 2 related items that a single OR query would have surfaced.\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Work matches description\\n- [ ] Plan or implementation complete\\n</div>\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **developer using Claude Code skills**, I want to **backlog search: add full-text search, regex, or/and query support** so that **the tooling becomes more capable and complete**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Session observation 2026-03-25: 8 backlog_list calls needed to find related items during #912 grooming\\n- **Priority**: P1\\n- **Added**: 2026-03-25\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\\n## Artifact Manifest\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n<!-- artifact-manifest:begin -->\\n| Type | Path | Status | Agent | Created |\\n|------|------|--------|-------|---------|\\n| task-plan | quick-backlog-full-text-search | current |  | 2026-03-25T17:47:07Z |\\n<!-- artifact-manifest:end -->\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"b96de135ce481b0e498e3cd716fa34edc9c62fd8995043ac63b4a90363084556\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABVWTbGg\"}"}